{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/f87c33259e5cca1a17995ef9df7a6c15.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon shattered \u2014 and the world froze. Civilization lies buried beneath years of ice. Now it\u2019s your turn to rise from the snow, scavenge what\u2019s left and forge your life in the cold. Get ready to survive in a beautiful but brutal open-world survival game set on a frozen post-apocalyptic Earth, where every step could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/cbb08066357061fba696b0626e60c78b.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the cataclysm that froze Earth. Explore a vast open-world buried in ice and battle extreme weather, hunger and exhaustion in a world where the cold itself is your deadliest enemy.\u00a0Hunt scarce wildlife, set traps, and scavenge every resource to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/813fdc4b73578b3cb69ce0d54d196613.poster.avif?t=1763068758\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/813fdc4b73578b3cb69ce0d54d196613.webm?t=1763068758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/42585ea97c4cb9ff7559ac0e3339daba.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scarce resources, craft vital tools and build shelters or massive bases to withstand blizzards and the relentless cold that devours the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/62a494ebca9af12ab9e27968121cb01b.poster.avif?t=1763068758\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/62a494ebca9af12ab9e27968121cb01b.webm?t=1763068758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/f5a9f4f462a7431442337accc341dec7.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Play solo or in online co-op (with up to 4 survivors) to explore a vast open-world survival landscape. Discover, orientate and survive together, forging bonds that can outlast the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/aed6e29e01a11bc90610d6e27a085843.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond the last safe walls - into the unforgiving white hell. Follow the faint signal of a friend long thought lost, through ice, storm and silence. Out there in the endless cold lies more than survival - it\u2019s where the last connection to what you\u2019ve lost still waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/96b4a79854b72f5df401b26459960907.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Venture into frozen territories that will push your endurance and survival skills to the limit. Explore cold zones, uncover valuable resources as well as rare loot and restore abandoned structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/95e2a1eca9dc43c8bf3b9af5b1f748ea.poster.avif?t=1763068758\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/95e2a1eca9dc43c8bf3b9af5b1f748ea.webm?t=1763068758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/cd74042324f6fcfee688fd2dca617b6c.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rescued dog becomes your partner and early-warning system. With sharp senses and unwavering loyalty, your canine companion helps detect danger and carries part of your load and sniffs for loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/51a77ab484d60790dfcfaaab52b65d8c.poster.avif?t=1763068758\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/51a77ab484d60790dfcfaaab52b65d8c.webm?t=1763068758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/cb1b56038fb400ec27f29518252a5543.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse abandoned cities, buried forests, caves or camps filled with secrets and salvage. By accessing lost technology you will understand the circumstances and uncover the mysteries of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/f3f37ffa32447f70704c7ab2538ab350.poster.avif?t=1763068758\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/f3f37ffa32447f70704c7ab2538ab350.webm?t=1763068758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/d7cf3a28653a41c593c64268ad2c17e1.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter survivors, raiders and rival factions struggling to survive the frozen apocalypse. Trade or fight for resources, territory, and the last remnants of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/b44551f7fa6ea93c7169b152248c8c82.poster.avif?t=1763068758\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/b44551f7fa6ea93c7169b152248c8c82.webm?t=1763068758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/ee26cc727d1756bd6331f7435e9eab3b.avif?t=1763068758\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2254990?t=1763068758","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/30644896ad16ac56ca9bb9f006999e731c81902b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763068758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/024db5584cd87b23dd37229e049378f2d4828bdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763068758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/024db5584cd87b23dd37229e049378f2d4828bdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763068758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains depictions of violence against humans and animals, as well as the use of tobacco, alcohol, and unspecified medicine to endure harsh cold conditions."},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app